editor_description = "Jankin, a drunk, a regular at the Cross Keys: harmless, full of stories. Gangly, flushed; a patched tunic, a coif, a wooden cup in his hand (tools/build/chr_jankin.py). Model is his body on its skeleton, with his clips (PersonModel). Feet at the origin, facing -Z. Head is his face (a FaceRig over the head model); Face is where the conversation camera looks. In the game both ride on the skeleton's head."
